# game/UpdateScript0.09.rpy:5432 #-#-# translate crowdin cami_events_intro_a01f3434:
msgid "[_R_] Mom took you in when Uncle Bobby ran off, after the feds took your house... if it wasn't for Mom letting you live with us, you'd be in some shitty run down apartment."
