"uspokój się, Camille."

# game/UpdateScript0.09.rpy:5474 #-#-# translate crowdin cami_events_intro_0d0d0958:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Wow, she stopped sluring her words! Losing everything sobered her up quick.{/i}"
