# game/UpdateScript0.09.rpy:5529 #-#-# translate crowdin cami_events_intro_23c7fd46:
msgid "[_C_] Well forget it! I'm not stripping for that mafia goon's customers, or for you and whoever you peddle your disgusting pictures to."
