# game/UpdateScript0.09.rpy:5619 #-#-# translate crowdin cami_events_intro_a2ed6b24:
msgid "[_M_] Unbelievable! After I took you into my home, you'd abandon us, just so you could sip Chateau wines and have your nails done?"
